blurb = "Depicts a night scene along the coast of Izumo (present-day Shimane prefecture), showing a cluster of weathered pines against a stormy sea.

Although this is a 20th-century [url=art_style:shin-hanga]shin-hanga[/url] print, it was printed entirely in shades of blue, similar to the 19th-century [url=art_style:aizuri]aizuri[/url] style."
